1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:04,040
Your breath is precious to many others who still see your worth.

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:07,640
Don't let just a few people destroy your life.

3
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,520
Just wait and see! I'm going to report you

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,360
to the Medical Council for being cruel to a patient.

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,920
You're unfit to be a doctor!

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,680
I can be a lot crueler than this.

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,760
Want to find out?

8
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:19,200
I’m really glad to see you again.

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,160
And don't you see me as a friend?

10
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,320
Just a friend?

11
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,760
Ms. Kie...

12
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:33,840
Ms. Kie...

13
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:37,950
Oh wow... How much did she eat?!

14
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,100
Ms. Kie!

15
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:44,200
Ms. Kie!

16
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:57,000
Huh... she didn't even take her phone with her.

17
00:02:58,140 --> 00:02:59,520
Where on earth did she go? Ms. Kie!

18
00:03:01,110 --> 00:03:02,280
Ms. Kie!

19
00:03:03,650 --> 00:03:05,120
Ms. Kie!

20
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,560
Ms. Kie!

21
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,530
Ms. Kie!

22
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,579
Ms. Kie! Where did she go?

23
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,340
Ms. Kie...

24
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:56,600
If I can't find her, am I going to get my salary docked?

25
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:59,020
Oh my, I’m in real trouble now!

26
00:04:00,730 --> 00:04:01,230
Let's do it

27
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:03,150
Ms. Kie!

28
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,610
Ms. Kie!

29
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,000
Ms. Kie!

30
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,720
Ms. Kie!

31
00:04:16,339 --> 00:04:16,980
Ms. Kie!

32
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:30,710
Ms. Kie!

33
00:04:46,150 --> 00:04:47,020
Ms. Kie!

34
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:49,220
Ms. Kie!

35
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:51,590
Ms. Kie!

36
00:04:54,170 --> 00:04:56,400
Gosh, where did she disappear to? Ms. Kie!

37
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:58,060
Ms. Kie!

38
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:02,170
Wait, is that Ms. Kie over there?

39
00:05:05,610 --> 00:05:08,520
Wow! Out with a new girl?!I have to snap a picture of this!

40
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,640
Hold on a sec, let me open the camera...

41
00:05:11,670 --> 00:05:14,400
All right, here we go. This spot is perfect!

42
00:05:21,650 --> 00:05:22,140
Ms. Kie!

43
00:05:23,420 --> 00:05:24,120
Ms. Kie!

44
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:33,200
Help! Someone's drowning!

45
00:05:35,409 --> 00:05:36,450
Is Ms. Kie drowning?

46
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:39,180
I’m here to help you!

47
00:05:40,530 --> 00:05:41,470
Ms. Kie..

48
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:05,860
The doctor has already finished the examination, Ms. Vodka.

49
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:12,690
Water...

50
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:15,560
Oh, she just woke up!

51
00:07:15,590 --> 00:07:16,580
Let me call you back.

52
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:25,590
Bring me water.

53
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:32,530
Bring it to me.

54
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:55,170
What's wrong?

55
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,490
You tried to end your life.

56
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:03,680
Why would you commit suicide over something so minor?

57
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:06,650
Your life is worth so much more than that.

58
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,150
Stop talking nonsense.

59
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:10,240
I wasn't trying to kill myself.

60
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:15,040
But you were a second away from it!

61
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,820
If that woman hadn't stepped in to save you,

62
00:08:18,450 --> 00:08:21,580
I’d be in your mourning right now…

63
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,730
and I don't want that.

64
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:28,220
Who saved me?

65
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,200
How are you feeling?

66
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,960
I’m… feeling better now.

67
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,030
Thank you

68
00:10:10,590 --> 00:10:11,870
for saving my life.

69
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:25,730
Is there something on your mind?

70
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,060
You can speak freely, I won't get angry.

71
00:10:33,220 --> 00:10:37,020
Well… I might have misunderstood,

72
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,760
but when I saw you walking into the sea.

73
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,640
I thought you were trying to hurt yourself.

74
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,900
I wasn't trying to end my life.

75
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:59,960
Are you saying you just went for a dip and got swept away by a wave?

76
00:11:01,140 --> 00:11:01,840
Yes.

77
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:06,040
Even though I shouted your name

78
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,040
and you didn’t even turn around?

79
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:11,690
I just didn't hear you.

80
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:13,800
I couldn't hear a single thing.

81
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,290
Okay.

82
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:21,170
But common sense tells us that when someone is drowning,

83
00:11:21,460 --> 00:11:22,960
they fight to survive.

84
00:11:23,530 --> 00:11:27,440
Unless... they meant to drown.

85
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:39,840
I... was drunk.

86
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:45,470
I just drank a bit too much.

87
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:52,190
Thank you for finally admitting it.

88
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:00,640
I've admitted it.

89
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:02,480
So...

90
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:07,010
Can I please repay you, okay?

91
00:12:14,130 --> 00:12:15,010
Please,

92
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:16,780
please,

93
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:18,460
please?

94
00:12:19,650 --> 00:12:20,140
please.

95
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,200
Fine,

96
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:27,680
I’ve given up.

97
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:31,910
But it can't exceed 100 baht, Deal?

98
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:35,820
Deal.

99
00:12:39,060 --> 00:12:40,090
You promise?

100
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:44,650
I promised.

101
00:12:50,650 --> 00:12:51,900
You can hurt,

102
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:54,000
You can cry.

103
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:57,040
but please don't hurt yourself.

104
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:08,960
Your breath is precious to many others who still see your worth.

105
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:19,720
Don't let just a few people destroy your life.

106
00:13:23,780 --> 00:13:24,310
Yes.

107
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,640
Oh... has Ms. Pim already left, Ms. Kie?

108
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:05,680
She's gone.

109
00:14:08,390 --> 00:14:09,600
But it's good that she left anyway.

110
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:13,550
Who on earth acts like that at her age,

111
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:15,920
nagging like an old aunt.

112
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:20,550
Well... she was just nagging a little bit.

113
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,920
if Khun Pim hadn't saved you,

114
00:14:22,950 --> 00:14:25,490
you'd probably be dead by now.

115
00:14:26,010 --> 00:14:28,810
At first, I thought you were flirting with her,

116
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,390
so I raised my phone to take a video.

117
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:32,390
I didn't think you were actually going to drown.

118
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,260
What are you taking pictures of, Nuan?

119
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:42,020
Nuannaree.

120
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:47,580
Deduct one thousand.

121
00:14:50,620 --> 00:14:52,620
Deduct ten thousand.

122
00:15:01,570 --> 00:15:02,420
Ten thousand, huh?

123
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,060
Hand it over.

124
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:13,260
Yes, ten thousand.

125
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:37,070
What?

126
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:39,430
Please return my phone.

127
00:15:40,490 --> 00:15:41,300
No way.

128
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:45,410
Ms. Kie, please give my phone back.

129
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:47,180
Please, I'm begging you.

130
00:15:47,410 --> 00:15:49,790
For what you did, almost getting me killed

131
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:51,350
and then pulling a stunt like recording a video like this?

132
00:15:53,690 --> 00:15:55,190
Ms. Kie,

133
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:57,500
Ms. Kie,

134
00:15:57,530 --> 00:16:00,070
I'm begging you, please.

135
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:01,530
No way.

136
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,530
You might leak this video.

137
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:08,260
Ms. Kie, please give my phone back.

138
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:09,140
I really can't live without it.

139
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,430
I swear I'll jump into the sea!

140
00:16:10,450 --> 00:16:11,260
Fine.

141
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,710
Take my card to buy a new one,

142
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:15,590
and then go get to work.

143
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:18,520
In that case, take it!

144
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:20,520
I'm giving it to you, Ms. Kie!

145
00:16:21,540 --> 00:16:24,280
By the way, what do you want me to do?

146
00:16:27,490 --> 00:16:28,780
Go look into Ms. Pim's background.

147
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:33,850
Oh, the fling?

148
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,350
Right on it!

149
00:17:03,350 --> 00:17:06,410
A patient jumped down from the second floor and got injured, Doctor.

150
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:08,410
Have they been sent for an X-ray yet?

151
00:17:08,650 --> 00:17:09,859
The patient refuses.

152
00:17:16,450 --> 00:17:17,740
Hello, P'Siva.

153
00:17:18,210 --> 00:17:20,270
What's wrong with your younger sibling?

154
00:17:21,150 --> 00:17:22,480
Are you blind?

155
00:17:25,849 --> 00:17:26,579
Mira...

156
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:30,030
well, this is my younger sibling I used to tell you about.

157
00:17:30,990 --> 00:17:33,050
She fell from the second floor.

158
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,190
I want to change hospitals.

159
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:37,980
Mira.

160
00:17:39,250 --> 00:17:40,400
Can the doctor examine my younger sister, please?

161
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:43,520
Ouch!

162
00:17:49,150 --> 00:17:50,650
Her anklebone is likely fractured.

163
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:52,770
Send her for an X-ray.

164
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:53,180
Yes.

165
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:56,560
If you already know my anklebone is fractured, just treat it!

166
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:57,860
Why bother with an X-ray?

167
00:18:00,250 --> 00:18:01,210
Mira.

168
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:03,070
What?

169
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:05,070
Or is it because you think someone else is more important than me?

170
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:11,340
Such an attention-seeker.

171
00:18:11,890 --> 00:18:14,620
That fall probably wasn't even an accident.

172
00:18:15,130 --> 00:18:16,960
You just wanted to get attention, didn't you?

173
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:19,050
This is my family's business!

174
00:18:19,290 --> 00:18:21,630
Your job is just to treat patients, so do your job!

175
00:18:22,990 --> 00:18:23,920
Fine, then.

176
00:18:24,420 --> 00:18:26,930
But the patient must sign a consent form stating she won’t hold us liable

177
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,930
if the treatment results in a deformed leg.

178
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:32,390
And after that... who knows?

179
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:36,080
Your Brother would probably be so ashamed to have a little sister like you.

180
00:18:39,250 --> 00:18:41,340
Go get the consent form for the patient to sign.

181
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:42,000
Yes.

182
00:18:45,610 --> 00:18:47,010
Is there something wrong with you?

183
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,210
Fine, X-ray then.

184
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,530
You should’ve just done that from the beginning.

185
00:18:57,860 --> 00:18:59,280
Send the patient for an X-ray, please.

186
00:18:59,640 --> 00:18:59,960
Yes.

187
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:13,300
The treatment went well.

188
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:15,180
Since your ankle is fractured,

189
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:17,260
you’ll need to wear a soft cast for about five weeks,

190
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:18,610
and it should heal up nicely.

191
00:19:19,210 --> 00:19:22,810
After the cast comes off, you might need some additional physical therapy.

192
00:19:24,610 --> 00:19:27,710
Once the medication wears off, it’s going to hurt a bit.

193
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:30,600
so please bear with it, patient.

194
00:19:32,530 --> 00:19:33,420
If you were a good doctor,

195
00:19:33,450 --> 00:19:34,960
you wouldn't let your patients suffer in the first place.

196
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:39,480
P’Siva, this doctor isn't skillful at all.

197
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,950
I want to transfer to another hospital.

198
00:19:41,370 --> 00:19:44,080
Mira, apologize to the doctor right now.

199
00:19:49,140 --> 00:19:50,520
I’m so sorry on behalf of my sister.

200
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:52,940
It's alright.

201
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:56,100
If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.

202
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,200
That doctor is your ex, isn’t she?

203
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:13,360
No.

204
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,040
Don’t lie to me.

205
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:17,780
You and that woman were pretty close.

206
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:20,030
Not to mention the way you were looking at her.

207
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:21,680
I don't believe you.

208
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:22,780
Seriously.

209
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,140
I actually asked her to be my girlfriend three times,

210
00:20:26,630 --> 00:20:28,020
but she turned me down every single time.

211
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,840
Really?

212
00:20:32,610 --> 00:20:34,630
Yeah… Go to sleep now.

213
00:20:38,580 --> 00:20:42,880
Good thing that doctor is blind, then.

214
00:21:13,520 --> 00:21:16,630
What are you doing here so early, Ms. Kie?

215
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,680
Compensation  can't exceed one hundred baht.

216
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,900
Would you like a bowl of congee?

217
00:21:55,060 --> 00:21:56,120
Let's eat together!

218
00:21:57,940 --> 00:21:59,460
I went out of my way to buy this for you,

219
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:01,930
but since you take such good care of me,

220
00:22:02,910 --> 00:22:04,350
how can I ever repay you?

221
00:22:08,010 --> 00:22:10,200
I'm not expecting anything in return anyway.

222
00:22:12,120 --> 00:22:14,620
Just having someone to share breakfast with .

223
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:17,220
It is enough happiness for me.

224
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,120
I'd better eat quickly.

225
00:22:33,570 --> 00:22:34,360
Aren't you going to eat?

226
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:36,250
Try some first.

227
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:42,740
How is it?

228
00:22:45,280 --> 00:22:46,080
It's delicious.

229
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:49,010
Where did you buy this?

230
00:22:51,060 --> 00:22:53,060
If I said I made it myself,

231
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:57,410
would you believe me?

232
00:23:01,410 --> 00:23:02,360
You're so talented.

233
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,560
You're so easy to fool.

234
00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:10,010
I actually bought it from my regular spot.

235
00:23:10,930 --> 00:23:12,040
Do you like it?

236
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:15,730
I do.

237
00:23:30,250 --> 00:23:31,820
You can call me

238
00:23:32,670 --> 00:23:35,630
Whiskey or just Kie.

239
00:23:37,630 --> 00:23:38,930
Um…

240
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:45,040
Whis.. Ms. Kie.

241
00:23:48,380 --> 00:23:50,620
Since you call me that,

242
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:55,850
I’ll get back at you by calling you Ms. Pim too.

243
00:24:01,730 --> 00:24:07,070
But wait… I heard you say that just having a dining friend would be nice.

244
00:24:08,230 --> 00:24:12,360
So, would it be okay if I came to eat with you every day?

245
00:24:17,180 --> 00:24:20,640
Wait… would your boyfriend mind?

246
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,520
I'm single.

247
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,540
Then….

248
00:24:34,940 --> 00:24:38,250
If you want to come have breakfast with me every day,

249
00:24:40,140 --> 00:24:41,620
I don't mind at all.

250
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,410
Just one thing,

251
00:24:45,780 --> 00:24:46,860
don't buy anything to bring here again.

252
00:24:47,940 --> 00:24:49,260
I'll make it for you myself.

253
00:24:50,530 --> 00:24:53,840
You gave me permission, so let's promise, okay?

254
00:24:56,990 --> 00:24:57,980
I promise.

255
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,450
Get out!

256
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:25,320
You've already thrown everything you could.

257
00:25:26,140 --> 00:25:27,520
Are you going to let me treat you now or not?

258
00:25:28,220 --> 00:25:29,160
I'm not going.

259
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:30,690
Don't be difficult.

260
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:32,690
I'm not as kind as your brother.

261
00:25:33,220 --> 00:25:34,860
Are you going to go for treatment nicely,

262
00:25:35,180 --> 00:25:39,360
or should I call the nurses to tie you up and drag you there?

263
00:25:41,040 --> 00:25:43,740
Just wait and see! I'm going to report you

264
00:25:43,780 --> 00:25:45,660
to the Medical Council for being cruel to a patient.

265
00:25:45,710 --> 00:25:47,240
You're unfit to be a doctor!

266
00:25:57,100 --> 00:25:58,070
What are you doing?

267
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:12,410
I can be a lot crueler than this.

268
00:26:13,070 --> 00:26:14,060
Want to find out?

269
00:26:16,560 --> 00:26:17,190
No.

270
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,500
Good.

271
00:26:49,660 --> 00:26:52,930
I honestly never thought anyone would actually be able to tame Mira.

272
00:26:54,280 --> 00:26:57,280
Don't you think you've been spoiling her a bit too much, P’Siva?

273
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:59,530
I suppose I have.

274
00:27:00,170 --> 00:27:03,050
Our parents passed away when she was very young,

275
00:27:03,580 --> 00:27:05,930
and with a ten-year age gap between us,

276
00:27:07,330 --> 00:27:09,050
I haven't had much time to look after her.

277
00:27:09,260 --> 00:27:11,410
I mostly just spoil her with money.

278
00:27:12,220 --> 00:27:14,100
I must apologize on Mira's behalf.

279
00:27:14,810 --> 00:27:17,820
Hearing this makes me start to feel sorry for that stubborn girl.

280
00:27:19,070 --> 00:27:21,730
As for her, if she doesn't cause any more trouble,

281
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,210
I won't scold her.

282
00:27:23,930 --> 00:27:24,360
Um

283
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:41,100
I'm finished.

284
00:27:41,330 --> 00:27:42,510
I want to go back to my room.

285
00:27:46,740 --> 00:27:47,070
Siva, you should go.

286
00:27:47,070 --> 00:27:50,520
Go ahead, before that stubborn girl causes another scene.

287
00:28:09,910 --> 00:28:11,820
How will you be getting back, Pim?

288
00:28:11,860 --> 00:28:13,130
I'll call a ride to pick me up.

289
00:28:14,360 --> 00:28:16,360
Is that the car you called?

290
00:28:18,360 --> 00:28:19,760
Excuse me, I'll be taking my leave now.

291
00:29:07,320 --> 00:29:08,590
Did you come to pick me up?

292
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:12,160
No, I just happened to be passing by.

293
00:30:34,340 --> 00:30:35,200
Ms. Nuan

294
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:37,060
Oh, yes?

295
00:30:37,100 --> 00:30:38,480
I brought the clothes back.

296
00:30:39,500 --> 00:30:40,320
Thank you.

297
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:42,610
And where is Ms. Kie?

298
00:30:43,820 --> 00:30:46,200
Over there, by the pool.

299
00:30:46,610 --> 00:30:48,830
She only just recovered from a hangover two days ago,

300
00:30:48,850 --> 00:30:50,090
and she's already back to drinking again.

301
00:31:32,620 --> 00:31:34,090
May I sit with you?

302
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,120
Please stop drinking.

303
00:31:54,120 --> 00:31:57,330
Who do you think you are to order me around?

304
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,770
And don't you see me as a friend?

305
00:32:12,460 --> 00:32:13,420
Just a friend?

306
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:24,880
Let go of me !

307
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:25,600
No, I won't.

308
00:32:26,170 --> 00:32:26,660
Let go of me.

309
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:27,270
No.

310
00:32:27,310 --> 00:32:27,690
Let me go.

311
00:32:30,610 --> 00:32:32,740
Ms. Kie, I'm sorry.

312
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,630
I didn't mean to.

313
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,650
Ms. Kie,

314
00:32:54,770 --> 00:32:55,760
please let me go.

315
00:32:58,600 --> 00:33:00,600
Just a moment ago, you said you wouldn't let go, didn't you?

316
00:33:06,660 --> 00:33:10,520
And why are you blushing?

317
00:33:18,190 --> 00:33:23,400
Or have you never been hugged by anyone before?

318
00:33:31,930 --> 00:33:33,320
I am so happy

319
00:33:34,840 --> 00:33:36,840
to be the very first person to hug Ms. Pim.

320
00:33:42,570 --> 00:33:44,300
Ms. Kie, you are very drunk.

321
00:33:45,180 --> 00:33:46,300
Please let me go.

322
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:50,860
I really am drunk.

323
00:34:37,659 --> 00:34:39,060
I'll take my leave and head home now.

324
00:35:35,620 --> 00:35:37,660
Stop overthinking right now, Pim!

325
00:36:05,170 --> 00:36:06,110
Hello.

326
00:36:08,540 --> 00:36:09,700
Have you reached home yet?

327
00:36:12,270 --> 00:36:13,520
I'm home now.

328
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:18,520
Ms. Pim…

329
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:20,320
Yes?

330
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:26,180
Were you angry with me just now, Ms. Pim?

331
00:36:28,690 --> 00:36:30,690
No, I wasn't angry.

332
00:36:38,140 --> 00:36:39,640
What’s wrong with you, Ms. Kie?

333
00:36:41,220 --> 00:36:42,660
But I'm angry with myself

334
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,400
for making you feel uncomfortable.

335
00:36:50,100 --> 00:36:51,310
I won't drink anymore.

336
00:36:53,040 --> 00:36:54,490
If you don't want me to drink,

337
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:57,240
I won't drink.

338
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:08,760
It's for your own health.

339
00:37:12,600 --> 00:37:13,870
It's for you, actually.

340
00:37:19,890 --> 00:37:20,920
Good night.

341
00:37:22,600 --> 00:37:23,610
See you tomorrow.

342
00:37:25,040 --> 00:37:26,510
Good night to you too, Ms. Kie

343
00:38:06,650 --> 00:38:08,060
Dad, when did you get here?

344
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,930
I've been here since early evening,

345
00:38:11,460 --> 00:38:13,570
And where have you been, huh?

346
00:38:13,610 --> 00:38:14,740
Coming home so late at night.

347
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,490
I went to a friend's house.

348
00:38:19,750 --> 00:38:21,500
Her home is right near ours.

349
00:38:35,610 --> 00:38:38,630
Wow, all dressed up so nicely first thing in the morning!

350
00:38:38,650 --> 00:38:40,040
Are you going to see Ms. Pim?

351
00:38:40,070 --> 00:38:40,620
Mind your own business.

352
00:38:40,920 --> 00:38:42,500
Go get your work done.

353
00:38:43,500 --> 00:38:45,390
Yes, boss.

354
00:38:45,430 --> 00:38:47,520
Don't forget my bonus, okay?

355
00:38:48,860 --> 00:38:49,710
If I get a bonus, then...

356
00:38:51,070 --> 00:38:51,920
Go back to sleep

357
00:38:59,070 --> 00:39:00,230
Ms. Pim...

358
00:39:00,870 --> 00:39:02,430
I bought something for you.

359
00:39:03,340 --> 00:39:04,290
Ms. Pim?

360
00:39:13,870 --> 00:39:15,060
How did you get here?

361
00:39:16,290 --> 00:39:16,980
Is that Kie?

362
00:39:20,130 --> 00:39:21,650
Breakfast is ready.

363
00:39:29,770 --> 00:39:32,090
Please come have breakfast together, Ms. Kie

364
00:39:33,420 --> 00:39:34,170
Are you this lonely,

365
00:39:34,540 --> 00:39:38,000
wanting a dining companion so badly that you've lowered your standards this much?

366
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:41,620
Ms. Kie..

367
00:39:42,310 --> 00:39:43,870
Last night you acted all shy,

368
00:39:44,850 --> 00:39:47,130
but now you're clinging to a man's arm.

369
00:39:48,060 --> 00:39:49,890
Did you forget the act you put on yesterday?

370
00:39:51,080 --> 00:39:54,420
Or have you already slept together,

371
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:56,730
so you don't need to pretend anymore?

372
00:39:58,670 --> 00:40:00,610
You act better than a super star.

373
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,900
Please listen to me first, Ms. Kie.

374
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,180
What?

375
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:06,760
What are you going to lie about this time?

376
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:08,720
You..

377
00:40:10,460 --> 00:40:11,210
What?

378
00:40:12,930 --> 00:40:14,110
Did I hit a nerve?

379
00:40:14,780 --> 00:40:15,830
Hey..

380
00:40:16,310 --> 00:40:19,410
If you're going to be someone's mistress, at least have some standards.

381
00:40:20,770 --> 00:40:22,790
don't just grab some random old geezer.

382
00:40:26,640 --> 00:40:29,990
Ms. Kie, please get out of my house.

383
00:40:30,010 --> 00:40:31,880
And stop bad-mouthing me once and for all.

384
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:36,850
Does someone like you have the right to speak?

385
00:40:38,030 --> 00:40:39,830
As if extorting money from my mom wasn't enough,

386
00:40:40,290 --> 00:40:41,970
you went and tore my family apart.

387
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:45,430
Low-class behavior like this really suits you guys, doesn't it?

388
00:40:47,430 --> 00:40:48,350
Pim, go inside the house.

389
00:40:54,830 --> 00:40:57,200
Insult me all you want, I don't care,

390
00:40:57,690 --> 00:40:59,690
but you have no right to insult my father.

391
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:05,720
Dad.. ?

392
00:41:06,820 --> 00:41:08,420
Get out of my house right now!

393
00:41:11,540 --> 00:41:12,770
Pim, go inside first,

394
00:41:12,970 --> 00:41:14,010
I will follow you shortly.

395
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:22,860
Ms. Kie, you should go home and cool off a bit.

396
00:41:25,060 --> 00:41:26,000
Excuse me.

397
00:41:39,130 --> 00:41:42,250
Oh, Ms. Kee! Why are you back so soon?

398
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:44,510
What were you up to?

399
00:41:44,530 --> 00:41:46,090
Why is your cheek so red like that?

400
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:51,210
Mind your own business.

401
00:41:52,090 --> 00:41:53,300
Go pack my bags.

402
00:41:53,340 --> 00:41:54,410
I will be heading back to Bangkok.

403
00:41:55,290 --> 00:41:56,270
Ms. Kie...

404
00:41:58,500 --> 00:42:01,660
But didn't you just leave to see Ms. Pim this morning?

405
00:42:04,050 --> 00:42:05,230
What happened to you?

406
00:42:07,310 --> 00:42:08,390
Alright, fine, I won't butt in, sis.

407
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:14,150
I knew she was vicious,

408
00:42:15,670 --> 00:42:17,850
but I didn't think she would be this vicious.

409
00:42:20,940 --> 00:42:22,170
I'm so sorry, Dad,

410
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:25,850
for causing you to get sworn at like that.

411
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,310
It's completely fine, dear.

412
00:42:29,700 --> 00:42:31,810
She has misunderstood me for a long time.

413
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:34,370
Don't let it weigh on you, okay?

414
00:42:37,260 --> 00:42:38,010
Yes.

415
00:42:40,520 --> 00:42:41,850
And are you holding up?

416
00:42:42,070 --> 00:42:44,450
You still have to meet with the finance company's representative.

417
00:42:48,040 --> 00:42:48,860
I'm holding up.

418
00:42:50,080 --> 00:42:51,840
I'll just put on heavy makeup.

419
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:54,330
and I'll be okay.

420
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:57,370
Well, my strong girl.

421
00:43:01,460 --> 00:43:02,510
Try not to overthink it.

422
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:24,530
Hello, I'm Pim from the PM Anti-Aging Company.

423
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:33,650
Excuse me?

424
00:44:02,260 --> 00:44:03,110
Ms. Pim.

425
00:44:07,300 --> 00:44:08,550
Hello, Ms. Kaew.

426
00:44:20,790 --> 00:44:22,640
You’re so impressive, Khun Pim.

427
00:44:23,370 --> 00:44:25,370
Once I’ve gathered all the documents,

428
00:44:26,590 --> 00:44:28,710
I’ll contact you again.

429
00:44:29,990 --> 00:44:31,370
You’re very capable as well, Khun Kaew.

430
00:44:31,750 --> 00:44:34,570
There are still many things I need to do more homework on.

431
00:44:35,720 --> 00:44:37,890
If you need any additional documents,

432
00:44:37,930 --> 00:44:39,720
please feel free to reach out to me directly.

433
00:44:45,880 --> 00:44:46,630
Sure,

434
00:44:47,730 --> 00:44:51,070
I’m really glad to see you again.

435
00:44:51,980 --> 00:44:55,070
and even happier that we get to work together this time.

436
00:44:56,060 --> 00:44:58,340
If there's anything you need help with,

437
00:44:58,700 --> 00:45:01,150
you can reach me using the business card I gave you.

438
00:45:09,200 --> 00:45:12,470
I’m happy to be working with you too, Ms. Kaew.

439
00:45:29,390 --> 00:45:32,700
Are you feeling alright, Ms. Pim?

440
00:45:34,130 --> 00:45:35,580
You look a bit tired.

441
00:45:36,870 --> 00:45:38,570
If anything's on your mind, you can always talk to me.

442
00:45:46,090 --> 00:45:47,030
I'm fine, thank you.

443
00:45:47,400 --> 00:45:48,650
I guess I'm just a little tired.

444
00:45:50,010 --> 00:45:51,160
Please excuse me.

445
00:46:39,130 --> 00:46:41,850
P'Kie, I thought you said you were coming back next week.

446
00:46:42,400 --> 00:46:43,480
Why are you back early?

447
00:46:44,650 --> 00:46:47,290
Vod, are you in a rush to go to the hospital?

448
00:46:47,990 --> 00:46:50,480
I don't have any check-ups or shifts today,

449
00:46:50,520 --> 00:46:53,250
but I was worried about the kids, so I thought I'd pop in to check on them.

450
00:46:54,280 --> 00:46:55,330
Is something wrong?

451
00:46:58,080 --> 00:47:02,100
In that case, can I ask for your advice on something?

452
00:47:05,080 --> 00:47:07,550
You insulted her father right in front of her,

453
00:47:07,890 --> 00:47:09,610
getting slapped is the least of what you deserved.

454
00:47:11,440 --> 00:47:14,360
Well, how was I supposed to know Mr. Phong was his dad?

455
00:47:15,800 --> 00:47:18,510
Besides, that Mr. Phong did a horrible thing to our family, too.

456
00:47:20,360 --> 00:47:22,810
So after telling me all this,

457
00:47:23,360 --> 00:47:24,450
what is it that you actually want?

458
00:47:28,940 --> 00:47:30,180
From my perspective,

459
00:47:30,900 --> 00:47:33,770
things like this are actually fine. There's no need to overthink it.

460
00:47:34,490 --> 00:47:37,440
Just don't get involved with each other outside of business.

461
00:47:38,600 --> 00:47:40,740
Unless...

462
00:47:44,650 --> 00:47:45,350
But what?

463
00:47:46,340 --> 00:47:47,500
You're going to fall for her, aren't you?

464
00:47:53,680 --> 00:47:55,940
Have you already fallen for her?

465
00:47:58,840 --> 00:48:01,300
Yeah, I did.

466
00:48:02,300 --> 00:48:04,470
Well, then you have two choices.

467
00:48:05,340 --> 00:48:07,340
One, go apologize to her.

468
00:48:09,440 --> 00:48:10,310
And what's the second?

469
00:48:11,700 --> 00:48:13,450
Or else, it's over between you two.

470
00:48:16,980 --> 00:48:18,300
But ending things is probably for the best anyway.

471
00:48:19,150 --> 00:48:21,670
That guy only brings discord to our family.

472
00:48:22,940 --> 00:48:25,740
If we stayed together, we'd probably just end up fighting all the time.

473
00:48:26,930 --> 00:48:28,530
Where on earth did you get an idea like that?

474
00:48:31,300 --> 00:48:32,400
Dad.

475
00:48:46,400 --> 00:48:47,800
Wait, why did it have your name?

476
00:48:47,980 --> 00:48:49,070
It wasn't Mom's?

477
00:48:50,240 --> 00:48:51,250
What’s so strange about that?

478
00:48:51,980 --> 00:48:53,630
We run a hospital business,

479
00:48:54,050 --> 00:48:55,550
and Phong is a celebrity.

480
00:48:56,140 --> 00:48:57,970
Partnering up in an anti-aging business is

481
00:48:58,680 --> 00:48:59,670
a win-win for everyone.

482
00:49:01,280 --> 00:49:04,120
Ah, so this is what makes you think Phong

483
00:49:04,820 --> 00:49:06,530
is coming to break our family apart, huh?

484
00:49:09,170 --> 00:49:12,420
I’ve known Phong since back when he was dating your mom.

485
00:49:13,480 --> 00:49:15,630
But those two couldn't make it work,

486
00:49:16,710 --> 00:49:18,010
so I went ahead and pursued your mom.

487
00:49:18,490 --> 00:49:19,950
Then she started dating me

488
00:49:20,370 --> 00:49:21,940
until we had the three of you kids.

489
00:49:22,320 --> 00:49:25,540
Your mom knows full well that things wouldn't have worked out between her and Phong.

490
00:49:26,360 --> 00:49:29,450
Besides, when they broke up, neither of them felt any lingering regrets at all.

491
00:49:31,040 --> 00:49:33,270
But Mom still hangs out with that guy anyway.

492
00:49:33,670 --> 00:49:36,050
Well... they stay in touch as old friends,

493
00:49:36,570 --> 00:49:38,970
plus they’re business partners.

494
00:49:40,120 --> 00:49:43,890
You really have quite an overactive imagination, don't you? Huh?!

495
00:49:44,970 --> 00:49:47,750
Then back when Mom and Dad started sleeping in separate rooms,

496
00:49:48,270 --> 00:49:49,830
wasn't it because of a fight over Mr. Phong?

497
00:49:51,770 --> 00:49:54,110
Well, once I became the hospital director,

498
00:49:54,380 --> 00:49:57,290
I started getting off work late and keeping irregular hours.

499
00:49:58,070 --> 00:50:00,790
And your mom had to keep waking up throughout the night.

500
00:50:01,520 --> 00:50:04,510
So we talked it over and agreed to sleep in separate rooms.

501
00:50:05,790 --> 00:50:07,180
That's all there was to it.

502
00:50:07,600 --> 00:50:11,990
So Mom and Dad didn't fight?

503
00:50:12,500 --> 00:50:15,050
Yeah... We still love each other just as much as ever.

504
00:50:16,360 --> 00:50:19,430
Your mom has told you plenty of times that Phong is not involved with this,

505
00:50:20,060 --> 00:50:21,370
but you just wouldn't listen.

506
00:50:26,060 --> 00:50:27,070
Then...

507
00:50:29,060 --> 00:50:30,700
What should I do, Dad?

508
00:50:34,040 --> 00:50:35,640
Vod, help me out.

509
00:50:39,300 --> 00:50:40,360
You're my child.

510
00:50:41,280 --> 00:50:42,530
If you're brave enough to do it, be brave enough to face the consequences.

511
00:50:58,620 --> 00:50:59,780
Hold on a second, Dad.

512
00:51:00,660 --> 00:51:01,330
What that, dear?

513
00:51:02,120 --> 00:51:03,270
I forgot something.

514
00:51:03,470 --> 00:51:04,440
I'll be right back, okay?

515
00:51:04,790 --> 00:51:06,690
Hey wait, let me get you an umbrella.

516
00:51:06,730 --> 00:51:07,350
No, it's fine, Dad.

517
00:51:07,390 --> 00:51:08,330
Just wait here a moment.

518
00:51:08,350 --> 00:51:09,590
I'll be back real quick, just a second.

519
00:51:09,620 --> 00:51:10,210
Wait up, dear!

520
00:51:10,230 --> 00:51:10,760
Just a second, just a second.

521
00:51:10,790 --> 00:51:11,590
I'll be right back!
